2️⃣ Linked Allocation

Contiguous allocation की problem solve करने के लिए।

Idea

Blocks कहीं भी हो सकते हैं।

हर block next block का address store करेगा।

Example

Block 5 → Block 22 → Block 1 → Block 90

Visualization

5 → 22 → 1 → 90

File stored successfully.

Advantages
No External Fragmentation

Blocks कहीं भी हो सकते हैं।

Easy File Growth

नई block जोड़ दो।

Disadvantages
Slow Random Access

Suppose:

Need:

4th Block

Must traverse:

1st
2nd
3rd
4th
Pointer Overhead

हर block में pointer store करना पड़ता है।

Real-Life Analogy

Treasure Hunt:

Clue 1 → Clue 2 → Clue 3
